{
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "speaker": "the man",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "You had my note?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the man",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "I told you that I would call."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the man"],
      "text": "Pray take a seat. This is my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson, who is occasionally good enough to help me in my cases. Whom have I the honour to address?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the man",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes"],
      "text": "You may address me as the Count Von Kramm, a Bohemian nobleman. I understand that this gentleman, your friend, is a man of honour and discretion, whom I may trust with a matter of the most extreme importance. If not, I should much prefer to communicate with you alone."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the man"],
      "text": "It is both, or none. You may say before this gentleman anything which you may say to me."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the Count",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "Then I must begin, by binding you both to absolute secrecy for two years; at the end of that time the matter will be of no importance. At present it is not too much to say that it is of such weight it may have an influence upon European history."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the Count"],
      "text": "I promise"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Dr. Watson",
      "speak_to": ["the Count"],
      "text": "And I"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the Count",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "You will excuse this mask. The august person who employs me wishes his agent to be unknown to you, and I may confess at once that the title by which I have just called myself is not exactly my own."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the Count"],
      "text": "I was aware of it"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the Count",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "The circumstances are of great delicacy, and every precaution has to be taken to quench what might grow to be an immense scandal and seriously compromise one of the reigning families of Europe. To speak plainly, the matter implicates the great House of Ormstein, hereditary kings of Bohemia."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the Count"],
      "text": "I was also aware of that"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the Count",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "Our visitor glanced with some apparent surprise at the languid, lounging figure of the man who had been no doubt depicted to him as the most incisive reasoner and most energetic agent in Europe. Holmes slowly reopened his eyes and looked impatiently at his gigantic client."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Holmes",
      "speak_to": ["the Count"],
      "text": "If your Majesty would condescend to state your case, I should be better able to advise you."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "the King",
      "speak_to": ["Holmes", "Dr. Watson"],
      "text": "You are right. I am the King. Why should I attempt to conceal it?"
    }
  ]
}

