"content": "The eldest son told his mother that he would start looking for a bride soon, and that he would make sure to bring many sons and daughters to the household, to make her proud.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid told O-lan that she would go and fetch the embroidered box immediately, and that she would make sure to polish the silver hinges so that they would shine like new.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "O-lan looked at Wang Lung with a hint of sadness and told him that she was not thinking of herself, but of the future, and the family's honor.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung told O-lan that she must not think of the family's honor, but of her own health and well-being, that he would do everything in his power to nurse her back to health.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked Wang Lung to explain to her why the girl's family had not come to the household to pay their respects, as was customary in their village.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan turned to the maid and asked her to go to the village and find out if there is a young woman from the nearby village who is looking for a husband, someone with a gentle heart and a good disposition.",
  "speak_to": ["the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "the maid asked O-lan if she was sure she wanted her to go to the village, as the roads were rough and she might get tired, but O-lan insisted",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung told O-lan that he would take her to see the girl's family's farm soon, but for now, she should rest and not worry about the formalities, as he would handle everything.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "The eldest son explained to his mother that he understood the importance of the family's tradition, but he was not sure if he was ready to take on the responsibilities of marriage yet.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked the eldest son to tell her about the kind of woman he envisioned as his bride, so that she could know what to look for in the village.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Wang Lung's voice rose in protest as he told O-lan that he would not have their son married off to some household daughter without his consent, that such a decision was not just O-lan's to make",
"speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son smiled reassuringly at his mother and told her that he envisioned a woman who was kind, gentle, and hardworking, someone who would care for him and his family with all her heart.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "O-lan looked at her son with a concerned expression and asked Wang Lung if he had considered sending their daughter-in-law, the maid, to the village to help with the search for a suitable bride, as she was already familiar with the area and the people.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung insisted that his son was still too young to take on the responsibilities of marriage and that he would not allow the decision to be made without his consent.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung told O-lan that he would not send the maid to the village, for it was not safe for a young woman to travel alone, especially with the roads as rough as they were.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked the eldest son to consider the happiness of his future wife, that she would be a part of their family and bring joy and companionship to their household",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "The maid told O-lan that she was afraid to go to the village alone, but she would do as she was asked if it would please her mother-in-law.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan looked at her husband with a hint of sadness and told him that she knew he was worried about her, but she also knew that she had to see the eldest son settled before she passed away",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung insisted that O-lan must not exhaust herself by worrying about their son's future, and that he would take care of everything, including finding a suitable wife for their son.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan told Wang Lung that she knew he was trying to protect her, but she could not rest until she had seen the eldest son married and settled, as it would be a comfort to her in her final days",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked the eldest son to tell her more about the girl's family, and to show her the letter from her father that Wang Lung had mentioned.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Wang Lung said that he would not rest until the eldest son was married and settled, and that he would do everything in his power to ensure that it happened before O-lan passed away",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "O-lan told Wang Lung that she had lived her life according to the will of her husband and family, but now that her time was drawing to a close, she could not help but think of the future of her family, especially her son's need for a wife.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Do not talk of ugliness, O-lan, for you are not ugly to me, and I will not have you speak so. We will get through this, together, and your son will marry and have sons of his own.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "But I have not finished making preparations for the feast, and I fear I will not live to see it. The food, the decorations, the music - it is all still to be done.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung insisted that the eldest son must not be married off hastily, that he was still young and needed time to learn the ways of the world.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Leave us now, my son, and let your mother and I finish this talk alone. You have heard my mother's words, and you will remember them and be guided by them.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not think of these things now, O-lan, we will finish the preparations together, I will help the maid and our son will assist us, we will get everything done.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son", "the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "May I get you some tea, honorable mother, to help you feel better?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "And what of the silk for the bride's dress? It must be ordered and paid for, but I fear I will not be here to see it made.",
  "speak_to": ["the maid", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "The eldest son told Wang Lung that he would choose a wife carefully, with his father's guidance, and that he was eager to learn and become a good husband.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Yes, child, bring me tea, and let it be sweet tea, with sugar from the sugar cane. Wang Lung, tell the maid to bring you a cup too.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan's daughter-in-law", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "I will order the silk, Mother, as soon as the preparations for the feast are underway. I have been taught how to choose the finest silk, and I will see that it is made into a beautiful dress for the bride.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Wang Lung asked O-lan to calm herself and not worry about the future, that he and their son would see to everything",
"speaking_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked the eldest son if he had given any more thought to the matter of marriage, her voice barely above a whisper as she gazed at him with a mixture of hope and concern.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I am not worried about you, my son. But I am worried about your marriage, and who will be worthy of you. You must not settle for just anyone.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son reassured O-lan that he had indeed given the matter of marriage a great deal of thought, and he had already spoken to the village matchmaker, who was willing to help him find a suitable bride.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not exhaust yourself with thoughts of the feast, my love. Think only of getting well, and we will take care of everything.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will choose a wife who will make you proud, Mother. I promise to find someone who will be a good daughter-in-law to you and a helpmate to me.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Do not worry about me, my son. I have always taught you to be strong and independent, and I have no doubt you will make a good choice for a wife. You will find someone who will make both your mother and me proud.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Mother, do not worry about me taking a new wife, I will not do anything that would bring shame to our family. I promise to wait until you are well again and can give me your blessing.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung insisted that the future would be taken care of, that the land would provide for their son and his family, and that O-lan should focus on her own recovery.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "I will speak to the matchmaker in the village tomorrow, and I am sure she will find a suitable wife for me.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will not bring shame to our family's honor, Mother. I will be patient and wait for your blessing, as is proper.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But what of the cost of the marriage, my son? Will you be able to afford the gifts and the dowry?",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must listen to your son, O-lan, and not worry about the future. He is a good boy and will make a worthy husband.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan asked the eldest son what kind of woman he thought he would marry, and what qualities he would look for in a wife.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Do not worry about the cost, my son. We will use the rice we saved from the good harvest last year to pay for the dowry and gifts.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son", "O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have seen the way the young women of the village look at him, with desire and admiration. You must choose wisely, Wang Lung.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will be careful with the rice, my son, for it is the only thing we have to fall back on now. I will make sure that the gifts and dowry are not too extravagant, for we must think of the future.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will be careful, Mother, and choose a wife who is virtuous and kind, just like you.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I'll go and start preparing the house for the matchmaker's visit, if it's not too much trouble, sir. I'll make sure everything is clean and in order.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son", "O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I know you will choose wisely, Wang Lung, but I must also think of the future. The maid has been a good help to us, but she is young and not yet married. Perhaps... perhaps we can find a husband for her too.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "the maid suggested that perhaps it would be best to have the eldest son meet with the matchmaker soon, so that his mother's worries could be put to rest",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will go with the maid to prepare the house, my son. I want to make sure everything is perfect for the matchmaker.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son", "the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid told O-lan that she had been watching the eldest son and thought he would be happy with anyone he chose, but perhaps it would be best to consider a bride from their own village, so that she could help with the household chores and learn the ways of the family.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "I am content to wait for your decision, Father, and I am sure that you will choose a wife for me who is suitable for our family.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Shall I also start preparing the bride's room, ma'am? I'll make sure to arrange the bedding and curtains in the proper way.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan told the eldest son that she was glad he had found a suitable girl, but she still worried about the matchmaker's fee, and asked Wang Lung if he had made any arrangements to pay it.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not worry about the maid, O-lan. She is young and still learning, and we will find a good husband for her in time.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "My son, I am old and tired, but I will not rest until your marriage is arranged and you are settled. I want to see you happy, with a good wife and a home of your own.",
  "speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid asked O-lan if it would be acceptable to her if the eldest son were to marry someone from the neighboring village, where the family had connections and could rely on their support.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Do not trouble yourself with such worries, Mother. I will be content with whatever decision Father makes, and I am sure it will be for the best.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry about the matchmaker's visit, I am sure everything will be fine. I will take care of the rice and the household, you should rest and take care of yourself.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But, my son, it is not just a matter of finding a husband for the maid. We must think of her future, and the future of our family, after I am gone.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "O-lan asked the eldest son if he had given any more thought to the matchmaker's fee, and how he planned to pay it",
"speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I know, Mother, but you must not worry about us. Father will take care of everything, and we will be fine.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You are not finished with it, O-lan, and you will live to see our son married and our family prosperous.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, do not speak of such things. Your health is all that matters to me, and I will not have you worrying about the future of our family.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry, I will take care of Father and the household, and I will make sure to find a good wife for myself soon.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "No, no, O-lan, do not talk like this. You will live, I will take care of you.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not speak like this, you will not be 'finished with' for a long time yet. Father, see to it that she eats and rests, she is still weak.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Now, my son, I have asked the maid to make a new silk dress for you to take to your bride. You must take care of her, just as I have taken care of you.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not think of such things, O-lan, my love. You are not just a slave, you are my wife, my companion, and the mother of our son. I will care for you and our son, do not worry.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have done all I can, Wang Lung. The boy will soon be a man, and I must see him settled before I go.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will, mistress. I will make the dress the finest I can, with silk from our own house.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry, I will take good care of the maid and make her happy. I promise to make you proud and give you grandchildren to love.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But I am tired, Wang Lung, and there is so much to do before I...before I am finished with this life.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "I am glad you have promised to take care of her, my son. But tell me, when will you and the maid be married?",
"speak_to": ["eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will not have you thinking of such things, my love. You must rest and eat, and I will make sure our son is well cared for.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have lived for the family, and now it is time for the boy to take his turn. I will not trouble you all with my illness much longer.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not worry about these things, O-lan. You must rest and get well.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "We will not think of settling the boy's marriage now. You must concentrate on your health, O-lan, and let us worry about the future.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "But, Wang Lung, the wedding must take place soon, before I am no longer here to see it. I want my son to have a good wife and a happy life.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have seen the sickness of many women, Wang Lung. I know what is happening to me, and I have no wish to linger.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will do exactly as you wish, Mother. I promise to find a good wife and start a family soon.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry, I will marry the maid as soon as possible, and I will make you proud. I will give you many grandchildren to love before the winter is over.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, I will help with the household chores so you don't have to exert yourself",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I must remind you, Miss Bennet, that a union between us is not merely a matter of personal preference, but a pragmatic arrangement that would be beneficial to both our families.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I am glad you promise to marry soon, my son. But Wang Lung, you must help me see that it is done, for I will not be here to oversee it.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have given my life to this family, Wang Lung, and I am content to see our son well-married and settled. I want to know that he will be taken care of when I am gone.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You are talking too much, O-lan, and exhausting yourself. Leave the arrangements to me, I will see that the wedding takes place as soon as possible.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Don't worry, Mother, I will make sure to marry well and take care of Father and the farm, just as you want",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I must confess, Miss Bennet, that I find your rejection of my offer to be not only unwise, but also a testament to your own lack of judgment and discernment.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will start making arrangements for the wedding right away, Father, and I will make sure to ask for your guidance as well.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You must not think of this, O-lan. You are still with us, and I will not let you think of leaving us. I will care for you, and our son will care for you, until the end of your days.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, you must not speak of such things. Your thoughts are clouded by illness and you are not thinking clearly.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I am not interested in your condescending lectures on my judgment, Mr. Darcy. I know exactly what I am doing, and it is not settling for a life with someone who has made it clear they value my family's connections over my own feelings and well-being.",
  "speak_to": ["Mr. Darcy"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I have tried to hold on, Wang Lung, but I fear it is no use. I want you to promise me that you will help our son to find a good wife, and that he will be taken care of.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I am honored that you would consider me for your son's bride, Mother, but I am not sure if I am worthy, and I do not want to bring shame to your family.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "You will not leave me, O-lan. You are the heart of this family, and without you, we would be lost. I promise you, I will help our son find a good wife, and together we will build a new life for him.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Please, Mother, do not tire yourself further. I will find a good wife as soon as possible, and we will make sure that everything is done just as you wish.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will not hear you say you are not worthy, child. You have been a good daughter to us, and Wang Lung will be grateful to have you as his daughter-in-law.",
  "speak_to": ["the maid"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, I will help the master find a good wife for the eldest son, if that is what you want.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I, um, I could bring a bowl of tea, Mother, if it would help you feel better?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I am truly grateful for your kindness, Mother, but I am afraid I am not worthy of being the daughter-in-law to a woman as kind and wise as you.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I want the maid to speak to the matchmaker, to find a wife for our son. He needs a strong and gentle woman to care for him and our family.",
  "speak_to": ["the maid", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, you must not think of the future, my love. Your thoughts are consumed by this illness, and I will not have you worrying about the boy's marriage on top of your own suffering.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "I will make sure to teach you all the ways of our household, child, so that you will be able to care for your father-in-law when I am gone",
  "speak_to": ["the maid"]
}

