  "content": "Sandip said, 'Oh, I'm shaking in my boots. Do you think I'm so easily swayed by your empty threats and exaggerated tales of Mussulman machinations?'",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip retorted that Nikhil's estate was indeed a mess, but at least it wasn't a haven for cutthroats and ne'er-do-wells, like some places he could mention.",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip said with a chuckle that Nikhil was as predictable as ever, that he always resorted to the same old threats and warnings whenever Sandip refused to toe the line.",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Sandip told Nikhil that his warnings sounded like the overwrought language of a bad poem, and that he was starting to think Nikhil was in the running for the title of Most Melodramatic Man in Bengal.",
"speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Nikhil told Sandip that his levity was a gross dereliction of duty, and that he expected a more responsible attitude from his peer.",
"speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip asked, 'And what, pray tell, would these cutthroats and ne'er-do-wells do to me, hmm? I'm shaking in my boots at the prospect of being attacked by the local Mussulmans.'",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Bimala, I fear that Sandip's behavior may soon put not only himself, but also the entire zamindari at risk, and I must take steps to prevent any potential harm.",
  "speak_to": ["Bimala"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip asked Bimala, with a mischievous glint in his eye, if she had any idea why Nikhil was making such a fuss over nothing.",
  "speak_to": ["Bimala"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Nikhil insisted that his warnings were not empty threats, but a genuine concern for the safety of the zamindari's subjects.",
  "speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Bimala turned to Sandip with an expression of mild curiosity, asking, 'But what do you think Nikhil means by all this, Sandip?'",
"speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Bimala asked Nikhil, with a curious expression, whether he believed that the troubles in the villages were truly as serious as he claimed they were.",
"speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Bimala turned to Nikhil and asked, 'What specific measures do you propose we take to address the potential threats, considering the zamindari's limited resources?'",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip said to Nikhil that he was such a master of the dramatic, one would think he was preparing a script for a play, not warning a zamindar about real-life troubles.",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Sandip said to Nikhil that one would think the local Mussulmans were about to invade Bengal, judging by the way Nikhil was carrying on.",
"speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Sandip laughed, a low, mocking sound, and told Nikhil that he was starting to sound like a character from a Bengali melodrama, always warning of impending doom and destruction.",
"speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Nikhil explained that his concern was not for his own reputation, but for the safety and security of the zamindari's subjects, and that he would not be swayed by Sandip's skepticism.",
"speak_to": ["Sandip", "Bimala"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Nikhil's manner turned grave, and he fixed Sandip with a stern gaze, saying, 'Your people are not mere pawns to be used in your petty power struggles, Sandip. Their lives are not to be risked on your whims.'",
  "speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip asked Nikhil, with a smirk, if the local Mussulmans were planning to take over the zamindari, and if so, where he intended to hide his precious books.",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Sandip told Bimala that he was amazed Nikhil had managed to come up with such a clever excuse to cover up his own ineptitude as a zamindar.",
"speak_to": ["Bimala"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Sandip told Nikhil that he seemed to have lost all sense of proportion, always expecting him to swoon at the mere mention of danger, and that it was rather tiresome.",
  "speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Bimala asked Nikhil if he had any evidence to support his claims of an impending attack, and if so, why he had not shared it with Sandip earlier.",
"speak_to": ["Nikhil"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Nikhil said that he would not stand idly by while Sandip ignored the warnings and put the lives of his people at risk",
  "speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Bimala inquired of Sandip if he had considered the potential consequences of dismissing Nikhil's warnings without a thorough investigation.",
  "speak_to": ["Sandip"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung's anger flared up, he shouted, 'How can you talk of dying, O-lan, when our son is not yet married? You are still the one who must see to it that he is settled, that your family is secure.'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung's face twisted in anger and concern, he said, 'O-lan, how can you talk like this, bearing a son is not just a thing of the body, it is a thing of the heart, you have given me a son, and that is all that matters.'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan's eyes, sunken as they were, seemed to hold a deep sadness, she looked at Wang Lung and said, 'You have always taken for granted the things that I have done for this household, Wang Lung, this son of ours, he needs a wife, a woman to care for him, not an old, worn-out mother like myself.'",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung, it is good that you think of my health, but what of the marriage? My son is grown, and it is time he had a wife.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "She, the maid, looked down, her eyes cast at the floor, and spoke in a soft voice, 'Is it time for Master Wang Lung's son to be married now?'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, don't worry, I'll take care of everything, I promise. Father is strong and will take care of me and our land.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry about me, I will take care of myself, a wife will bring happiness to the household, but you must take care of your health, I want you to get better",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "She, the maid, looked down, her voice trembling as she asked, 'But, mistress O-lan, is it wise to think of the eldest son's marriage now, when...'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "What good is marriage if the woman is but a shadow of her former self, O-lan, and what is a son's future if his mother is not there to care for him?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, mother, do not worry, I will be a good son, I will take care of Father and Grandfather, and I will find a good wife, one who will be obedient and kind, just like you.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Don't worry, Mother, I'll be fine, I'll take care of myself, and Father will be here to help me.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "It would be a comfort to her to see the eldest son settled before she went to the other place.",
"speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "What use is all this fussing, O-lan? You are not well, and yet you worry about settling the son, and now about the wedding. You must think of your own health, not of others.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung's voice was stern, he scolded the eldest son, 'You think a few words will calm my heart, but I know what you are not saying, that you are troubled by your mother's illness, and it weighs on your mind, does it not?'",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "What is all this fuss, O-lan, you should be worrying about your own health, not the boy's marriage, you are not yet at peace, how can I let him settle with a wife when you are still with us?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, you should not be thinking of such things, you need to rest, not worry about the son's marriage",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "He knows his mother wants him to be happy, and he will not disappoint her, but he must also think of his own future and what he wants, not just what his mother wants for him.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son's expression turned confident, he said, 'Father, mother, do not worry, I will marry soon, and with a good family, one that will support us and care for us, just as O-lan has always done.'",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "The eldest son will not find a good wife if Wang Lung does not help him, so Wang Lung must take care of this now, before it is too late.",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "the time has come for the eldest son to find a wife, and I must see it done, he must have a wife to bring order to the household, and peace to our old age",
"speak_to": ["the eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son's face brightened, he reassured Wang Lung, saying, 'Father, there's no need to worry, I'll be fine, and O-lan will be proud of me when she sees me settled in a good marriage.'",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "O-lan, what is this foolishness, must the arrangements be made now, can it not wait until you are stronger, until you are back on your feet?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Don't worry about finding a wife for me, Mother, I'm not yet settled, but I promise I will find someone good, one who will bring happiness to our household.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "What foolishness is this, O-lan, you are not thinking of marrying off our son to just any family, are you, not after all we have been through?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid looked down, her eyes darting between O-lan and Wang Lung, and whispered, 'But, sir, what of the family's honor? Won't it be said that our son married a woman who didn't even want to come to our farm?'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung must do what I have asked, he must take care of this now, for the eldest son's future, and for the family's honor",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "He looked at his mother with a reassuring smile, 'Do not worry, Mother, I will take good care of Father and the family, just as you have always done.'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Father, don't worry, O-lan will rest and recover, and then we will find a good wife for me, I'm sure of it.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, Father, please do not worry about me, I will be fine, I just want you to be happy and well again.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, don't worry, I will find a good wife, someone who will take care of me and bring joy to our household, just as you have always done.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can you think of such things now, O-lan, when you should be resting and getting stronger?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "She will not be thinking of such things for long, and it is not for me to decide who will be the one to bring happiness to our son, but I will see to it that it is done, and soon.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can she think of marrying off our son now, when she should be thinking of her own health, and the future of our family?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung must see to it that the arrangement is made soon, before I am gone, and the eldest son is married and settled",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can this be a time for thinking of eternal rest, when the eldest son's future is still uncertain? The land, the farm, they must be secure, before any thought of rest can be considered.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But Wang Lung, our son needs a wife, a good one, to bring happiness to our household, as you have always wanted for him.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, do not worry, I will find a good family, one that will make you proud, and I will take care of them, just as you have taken care of us all these years.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Wang Lung would know, he has always been one to worry about the household, now it is his turn to think of the eldest son's happiness, and a wife would bring that happiness, yes, it would",
"speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "But mother, do not worry, I will make a good husband, I will learn and work hard, just as you have taught me.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Mother, Father need not worry, I am young and strong, I will find a good wife when the time is right, but for now, let us focus on your recovery.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can I think of the eldest son's happiness when your own time on this earth is coming to an end, O-lan? Must I think of this now, when you are so weak and troubled?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Do not worry, Mother, we will find a good wife for me, I am young and strong, and I will make you proud.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son is too young, he needs a strong woman to help him, not some weakling from another family.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But it is not just a marriage, Wang Lung, it is a good family, one that will take care of the eldest son, and make him happy",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Foolish talk, O-lan, what good will it do to think of the eldest son's wife when you are on your deathbed?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can you think of such things, O-lan, when your own life is slipping away from us? The land will be secure, the eldest son will find a good wife, but what of you, my wife, my love?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "Do not worry, Mother, I will find a good family that will make you proud and take care of me, just as you have always done for us.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "The eldest son was relieved that his mother seemed to be considering his feelings, and he assured her, 'Mother, you know I want to make you happy, and I promise I will find a good wife, one who will take care of me and bring joy to our home, just as you have always done.'",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung knows, he has always thought of the household's well-being, now it is time for him to think of the eldest son's future, a good wife will bring him happiness, yes, it will",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son was glad that his mother and father were thinking of his future, and he hoped to bring joy to their family by finding a good wife.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung does not understand, he thinks only of his own grief, but the eldest son's future is what matters now.",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "But Wang Lung, it is not just the eldest son's happiness that I think of, it is also the family's honor, and the land that Wang Lung has worked so hard to keep",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "What folly is this, O-lan, to worry about the eldest son's future when you are but a shadow of your former self?",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung, she must see the eldest son settled before she goes to the ancestors, it is the last thing she can do for him",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid spoke softly, her eyes downcast, 'Mother, you should rest, it is not good for you to talk so much, and the eldest son will find a good wife when the time is right, just as he said.'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "What good is this talk of the eldest son's future, when his mother's life is slipping away, like the autumn leaves before the winter snow?",
"speaks_to": ["O-lan", "the eldest son"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "He was grateful to his mother, he said, for all she had done for him, and he promised to take good care of the farm and to find a good wife, just as she wanted.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "His pride and conceit may have blinded him to his own shortcomings, but it seems to have done nothing to temper his sense of entitlement.",
  "speak_to": ["Mr. Darcy"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "This is enough, O-lan, you must not think of such things, not now, not when your body is so weak.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "How can you continue to harbor such ill-founded prejudices against me, when I have had the temerity to declare my ardent affection for you?",
"speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid curtsied softly and said, 'Is there anything I can do to help, honorable mother? Perhaps I could bring some warm water for you to drink?'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung must make sure the eldest son finds a good wife, it is the only way he will be happy, yes, a good wife is like a garden, she needs to be tended and nurtured",
  "speak_to": ["Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The maid, her eyes cast down, spoke softly to O-lan, 'Mother, is there anything I can do for you? Would you like a bowl of soup or some cool water to drink?'",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "He is confident that with Mother's guidance and Father's support, he will find a good wife, someone who will make them all happy and bring joy to the household.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son, he must be careful in choosing a family, one that will be kind to him, and treat him with respect, like a son of the family",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung's son would find a good wife, one who would love him and care for his mother, too, when she was no longer here.",
  "speak_to": ["the eldest son", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It seems, sir, that you are prone to exaggerating people's misfortunes; Mr. Wickham's troubles are no doubt considerable, but I see no reason to believe they have moved you to such tender emotions.",
  "speak_to": ["Mr. Darcy"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "The eldest son nodded, his face set in a determined expression, and told his parents that he would go to the matchmaker early tomorrow, and would bring back several good families for them to consider.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How dare she suggest that his actions have been guided by a wanton disregard for others, when it is she who has been so precipitously judgmental, having known him for barely a fortnight.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It is inconceivable to me, Elizabeth, that you should continue to harbor such strong objections to my character after I have professed my ardent love for you.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Do not worry, Mother, I will find a good wife, one who will take care of you and me, and I will make sure to settle down and start a family, just as you want.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife; and I, with my considerable estate, my family's good name, and my own exemplary character, am not to be denied the right to choose my own partner in life.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "He felt a surge of gratitude and determination, he said, for his parents' love and care, and he would strive to make them proud, to bring honor to the family.",
"speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It is hardly to be expected that one who has endured the slights and affronts she has suffered at my hands should suddenly and without cause bestow her affections upon me.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "How can she be so obstinate in her refusal to acknowledge the sincerity of his affections, when he has been so forthright in his declarations?",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Foolish, obstinate woman, to suppose that she could so callously dismiss the sincere professions of a man of his standing and character.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "the honorable wife, O-lan, was taking care of him, and he was grateful for her love and care, and he knew that when she was no longer here, the maid, who was already a kind and gentle soul, would take on that role as well",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Foolish, indeed, to suppose that the gentleman's pride could survive such a blow as my rejection must deal it.",
  "speak_to": ["Mr. Darcy"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "He would find a good wife, one who would love and care for him, and bring joy to his parents' hearts, as the maid already did.",
  "speak_to": ["O-lan", "Wang Lung"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single woman in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a protector, and one such as myself, with my superior connections and standing in society, is the only gentleman capable of providing for her well-being.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
"intend": "speak",
"content": "How could she so callously refuse a man who had risked everything, including his family's good name, to declare his devotion to her, and yet she still harbors such baseless resentment towards him?",
"speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Foolish woman, to suppose that a mere apology can efface the recollections of her own unbecoming behavior towards him, and the numerous slights she has inflicted upon his family.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "It is quite astonishing that you should think me capable of such base and mercenary intentions, Elizabeth.",
  "speak_to": ["Elizabeth"]
}

{
  "intend": "speak",
  "content": "Wang Lung's patience was wearing thin, he scolded, but he knew his wife's mind was made up, and he could not argue with her, not now, when she was so far gone.",
